WEBVTT

00:01:56.779 --> 00:02:03.077
is supporting only four-fold increase
in food grain production.

00:02:04.871 --> 00:02:06.122
What's happening?

00:02:06.789 --> 00:02:09.458
When you apply nitrogen fertilizers,

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:12.170
it is mostly in ammonium form.

00:02:13.129 --> 00:02:17.967
Ammonium form binds
the soil, doesn't move.

00:02:18.885 --> 00:02:22.597
Doesn't create any harmful
nitrogen byproducts.

00:02:23.055 --> 00:02:25.391
There's no problem with ammonium nitrogen.

00:02:25.391 --> 00:02:28.728
But there is a little bacteria,
lives in the soil,

00:02:28.769 --> 00:02:33.316
that started eating away
this fertilizer, nitrogen ammonium,